  "details": "As a user the Canny system becomes more and more filled while it's getting harder to use. Searching becomes more and more painful. Espacially very old reports seem never getting updates on there status.\n\nSolutions in my head are:\n\n* Status updates on most/all tickets, this would help to understand if the inside is still relevant or already solved. But it comes with high cost. Optionally would like to \"recommend\" status change and merges to support the VRChat Team with this work\n\n* Advanced Search, espacially filters for build number, create/update date and current status",
